   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate Children in Mexico With A Year-end Gift</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Can you imagine not being able to work because you cannot afford daycare or Early Childhood education for your child? Our families and the community we serve needs your help to fully fund operations in 2023.  Your continued help is desperately needed. With your fully tax-deductible contribution, made by the end of the day July 31, 2023, we can continue to maintain our important role in the lives of the children, their families, and their community in Mexico.</narrative>
  </description>
